### Description

The new `experimental_repairToolCall` function introduced in #3865 does not seem to support `streamText`. This appears to be due to an early exit inside `runToolsTransformation`:

https://github.com/vercel/ai/blob/bccd428efb312f06059f14c002023ba8f3c1c5f8/packages/ai/core/generate-text/run-tools-transformation.ts#L183-L202

If the tool isn't found, this code causes the transformation to exit early and not call the subsequent `parseToolCall`, which contains the repair logic.

### Code example

   ```ts
    streamText({
      experimental_repairToolCall: async (params) => {
        // Never called
      },
      messages,
      model,
      system: [
        "You are a tool calling assistant.",
      ].join("\n"),
      tools: {
        weather: tool({
          description: "Provides the weather for a given location",
          parameters: z.object({
            location: z.string(),
          }),
        }),
      },
    });
```

